			"widgets_values":[
				"1. 画面解析 (中文)\n导演构思：利用极速跟拍与空间无缝转场，营造强烈的视觉冲击。初始柔和光线瞬间切入高反差赛博朋克霓虹光，人物衣服上的发光纹路随环境提亮。动作设计强调瞬间发力与武器具象化的物理光效，转身斩击配合快速甩镜头（Whip pan），体现干脆利落的杀戮感。\n\n2. 最终视频提示词 (英文)\n> Fast tracking shot, rapid Dolly in morphing into a whip pan. The Asian woman in a neon-circuit qipao sprints forward, materializing a glowing mechanical broadsword in her grip. The background instantly dissolves from a traditional interior into a sprawling, neon-lit cyberpunk city. She pivots sharply, delivering a devastating slash that disintegrates a towering shadow monster. Volumetric neon lighting, rain-slicked reflections, realistic cloth simulation, cinematic motion blur, 35mm lens, 8k, photorealistic."
